approved.body:
{{greeting}}

Good news - an administrator has approved your {{instance}} account. You can sign in right away:

{{link}}
{{signature}}

locked.body:
{{greeting}}

An administrator has locked your {{instance}} account. You will not be able to sign in until it is unlocked again.

If you believe this was a mistake, please contact your administrator.
{{signature}}

unlocked.body:
{{greeting}}

Your {{instance}} account has been unlocked by an administrator. You can sign in again:

{{link}}
{{signature}}

deleted.body:
{{greeting}}

Your {{instance}} account has been deleted and your access has been revoked. If you sign in again later, you will need to be approved again, as if this were your first time.
{{signature}}

pending_approval.body:
{{greeting}}

A new account is waiting for your approval:

  Name:  {{requester_name}}
  Email: {{requester_email}}

You can review and approve this request here:

  {{link}}/admin/users
{{signature}}

login.body:
{{greeting}}

Your {{instance}} account was just signed in:

  Location: {{location}}
  IP:       {{ip}}
  Device:   {{device}}

If this was you, no action is needed. If it wasn't, review and end your active sessions here:

  {{link}}/profile
{{signature}}

new_device.body:
{{greeting}}

An already-signed-in session on your {{instance}} account was just used from a different device/browser than before:

  Previous: {{previous_device}}
  Now:      {{current_device}}
  IP:       {{ip}}

If this was you (a browser update, a new machine), no action is needed. If it wasn't, review and end your active sessions here:

  {{link}}/profile
{{signature}}

session_revoked_by_admin.body:
{{greeting}}

An administrator has ended one of your active {{instance}} sessions:

  IP:     {{ip}}
  Device: {{device}}

You will need to sign in again on that device if you still need access there. If you have questions, contact your administrator. Your other sessions, if any, are unaffected - review them here:

  {{link}}/profile
{{signature}}

anomaly.body:
{{greeting}}

Your {{instance}} account was just used from a different country than usual:

  Previous:  {{previous_country}}
  Now:       {{country}}
  IP:        {{ip}}

If this was you (traveling, VPN, a new network), no action is needed. If it wasn't, review and end your active sessions here:

  {{link}}/profile
{{signature}}
